BjKxurtRNvHaconJzLaUhC4YaJeRy8A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBvtSzEDkD9L6O7c3vCgHbldyFULkRWXTvi9x8oH9Atzw&oe=6A4E5532"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3uLTNYBgrvoQ7kNvwEPaFVg&_nc_oc=AdrWCAgT1bL3BXPSKLQpUxzF483VCzv2Z4K-PUrWZYw1awuQ_iTFJZFo8Vm3MY1kP-c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCgzy3DOe0NGQ9NJUErEQL9IQVYW-KonZKeokdw6FPMrA&oe=6A4E4257"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KYAE8SqyApAQ7kNvwEdH6-A&_nc_oc=Adp7mBD0Ohrup4W2z6YTNavYcIBGRcacWCGmWVAZEphMsFVoJoZbzw_214kos3iEAvI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDkR4QgM_6wgRw-ioWI9UyXW5qQRkgRmDBXppc78gI9Eg&oe=6A4E4795"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z3U2YtxCh3oQ7kNvwFs5nwH&_nc_oc=AdoTrn7RoTUxf7ivzOG1BTy2Wz8rPwzH72gKtRJYjWOFJf3MTjYV67xhd-p4Om5eEUg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDeGMHJ8WckDOCIkrMvSMdU1dS4i6zRUUUfq6YSE2t_4w&oe=6A4E5B42"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dl4PiqyM-aAQ7kNvwG9WTqg&_nc_oc=AdoH0mYaVRaKgSD2RF0Nbc1vVPAi8xdwnJ-N4nF-cupIoXUhlK5i_mb6jxakQnUpQ8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDi1sQqGEo6unyU5YBD0jeZD61w5gkm6BsNSbSVKWsxGQ&oe=6A4E41C4"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZLgFGTehzOUQ7kNvwGeFnP7&_nc_oc=Adq0dTyWsbY1U4ug-JU6gPyQ4DOXapxziqagFp2P9qHy3_y112IfOcMyDqHhNRq